e est\u00e9reo de 3,5 mm chapado en oro.<\/li><li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas<\/b><\/li><li>Compatible con todos los dispositivos m\u00f3viles.<\/li><li>Control remoto micro en cable.<\/li><li>Peso ligero, compacto y c\u00f3modo.<\/li><li>Peso: 13 gr.<\/li><li>Cintur\u00f3n de velcro + 3 pares de olivas de silicona (S,M,L)<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/div><div><h2>\u00bfQu\u00e9 hay en la caja?<\/h2><p><ul><li>ESTM-50WT<\/li><li>Cintur\u00f3n de velcro<\/li><li>3 pares de olivas de silicona<\/li><li>Manual del usuario<\/li><li>Documento de informaci\u00f3n de la garant\u00eda europea<\/li><li>Declaraci\u00f3n de conformidad de la UE simplificada<\/li><li>Tarjeta de redes sociales<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"AIWA","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.05,"unit_price":10.08,"unit_price_tax":10.08,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Auriculares","sub_category":"Auriculares","quantity":5,"brand":"AIWA","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_aiw-aur%20estm-50wt_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":5.08}}},"8435256897852":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435256897852",false],"wholesale_price":[31.62,false],"price":[36.62,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.64",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:84811","Cat. IDs: 71","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 71","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/users\/hipermercado\/www\/hiperme