a aQtivus para cafeteras Delta\/ Caja de 10","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p><h2>Intenso y estimulante<\/h2>De sabor agradable y consistente, Delta Q aQtivus es una aut\u00e9ntica expedici\u00f3n a las vibrantes culturas de Laos, Vietnam y El Salvador. aQtivus es una mezcla intensa y estimulante que produce un expreso con aroma a nuez tostada, un leve toque afrutado y algo de acidez.<br><h2>Asia y Centroam\u00e9rica<\/h2>aQtivus combina los mejores granos de caf\u00e9 de Laos, Vietnam y El Salvador. Todas las ca?psulas Delta Q esconden un viaje inolvidable a los mejores lugares de origen del caf\u00e9 en el mundo. El secreto de la calidad del caf\u00e9 Delta Q reside en la mezcla de granos de diferentes regiones productoras, combinados en la proporci\u00f3n exacta, adem\u00e1s del arte del tueste.<br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"DELTA","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.2,"unit_price":8.24,"unit_price_tax":8.24,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cocina","sub_category":"Capsulas de cafe","quantity":5,"brand":"DELTA","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_del-cafe%20aqtivus_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":3.24}}},"5601082038629":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["5601082038629",false],"wholesale_price":[3.24,false],"price":[8.24,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.2",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:86021","Cat. IDs: 48","Associat