illa para tapicer\u00eda<\/li>  <li>Accesorio para juntas extensible<\/li>  <li>Dep\u00f3sito de gran capacidad (0.4 litros) con sistema de vaciado f\u00e1cil e indicador \u00f3ptico de nivel.<\/li>  <li>Tiempo de carga: 4-5 horas<\/li>  <li>Peso: 3 kg<\/li>  <li>Medidas (alto x ancho x fondo): 1150 x 265 x 180 mm<\/li><\/ul><br><p><\/p><div><p><h2>ESPECIFICACIONES<\/h2><ul><li><b>General<\/b><\/li><li>Modelo<\/li><li>2in1<\/li><li>Dimensiones (AltoxAnchoxFondo)<\/li><li>1150 x 265 x 180 mm<\/li><li>Peso neto<\/li><li>3,2 kg<\/li><li>2en1: Aspirador escoba y de mano en un solo dispositivo<\/li><li>Si<\/li><li>Niveles de aspiraci\u00f3n<\/li><li>2<\/li><li>Autonom\u00eda (max)<\/li><li>55 min<\/li><li>Tiempo de carga<\/li><li>5 h<\/li><li>Nominal&nbsp;<\/li><li>25,2 V<\/li><li>Potencia de la bater\u00eda<\/li><li>2 Ah<\/li><li>Nivel de ruido<\/li><li>81 dB(A) re 1 pW<\/li><li>Aspirador con limpieza de bolsa<\/li><li>Sin bolsa<\/li><li>Bolsa<\/li><li>0,4 l<\/li><li>Cepillo para alfombra, moqueta<\/li><li>Mec\u00e1nico<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"BOSCH","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":4.6,"unit_price":144.12,"unit_price_tax":144.12,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Limpieza de Hogar","sub_category":"Aspiradores","quantity":2,"brand":"BOSCH","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_bosch-pae-asp%20bbh32551_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":139.12}}},"4242005278473":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["4242005278473",false],"wholesale_price":[160.51,false],"price":[165.51,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 4",false],"